cting an object in view and notice it doesn't update the object until you release the key / handle.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNA","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104697/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104697/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}